      "text": [
        ": سَأَلْتُهُ عَنْ رَجُلٍ أَدْخَلَ جَارِيَةً يَتَمَتَّعُ بِهَا ثُمَّ أُنْسِيَ حَتَّى وَاقَعَهَا هَلْ يَجِبُ عَلَيْهِ حَدُّ اَلزَّانِي قَالَ \"لاَ وَ لَكِنْ يَتَمَتَّعُ بِهَا بَعْدَ اَلنِّكَاحِ وَ يَسْتَغْفِرُ اَللَّهَ مِمَّا أَتَى\"."
      ],
      "translations": {
        "en.bab-ul-qaim-publications": [
          "Hadith.4610 - It is narrated from Zur'ah, from Sama'ah, who said:\nI asked him about a man who took a bondwoman for temporary marriage but forgot and had intercourse with her. Does he deserve the punishment of a fornicator?\nImam (as) replied: \"No, but he should perform the temporary marriage contract with her again and seek forgiveness from Allah (swt) for what he has done.\""
        ]
      }
    },
